s://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-09T09:52:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T09:56:41Z","body":"Any color will do IMO, as long as they are different enough. Translucent white sounds fine.\n\nThough not sure if outline will work actually. The rectangle is only drawn over tiles, so the outline will either need to be within each tile, or there is a risk it won't be visible at all.\n\nMaybe a stripes pattern?\n\n<img width=\"60\" height=\"60\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a591a412-90d9-4072-a468-910f897f93f6\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5230896008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5232724574","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122126#issuecomment-5232724574","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122126","id":5232724574,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN-UKXg","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_ur