dotengine/godot/issues/122126","id":5820449431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWu0Clw","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T19:07:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T19:07:11Z","body":"Here's a mockup of what this would look like using `WarningPattern.svg` set to 50% opacity. Thoughts?\n\n**Before erasing:**\n\n<img width=\"1124\" height=\"664\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d567dff-949f-4d5b-82e7-34f21330a52b\" />\n\n\n\n**During erasing:**\n\n<img width=\"1126\" height=\"662\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66a8704d-96da-4b3e-a9d5-62a91e22a1c7\" />\n\n\n\n**After erasing:**\n\n<img width=\"1125\" height=\"669\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d489d65-2253-46cc-8864-6089d04b16ef\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5820449431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5820866939","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122126#issuecomment-5820866939","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122126","id":5820866939,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWvNhew","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T19:34:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T19:34:10Z","body":"The pattern should have 2 colors I think (still translucent). Try this one on white tiles, it's likely invisible.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5820866939/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5822107366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122126#issuecomment-5822107366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122126","id":5822107366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWwZO5g","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T20:55:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T20:55:53Z","body":"Very good point!\n\nHere's a new svg I made. The foreground is ```#888888``` and the background matches the default editor BG (```#4d4d4d```). I tried it with ```#ffffff``` and ```#000000``` but it was too stark in my opinion. It also has fewer lines than the previous.\n\n<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14434d33-a10c-459f-9ca5-c5f3b3a8335b\" />\n\nAnd here's a mockup with better reference tiles (still at 50% opacity):\n\n<img width=\"1123\" height=\"659\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f0a3c0e1-62e7-4088-ba07-0b17527675a0\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5822107366/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5825446730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122126#issuecomment-5825446730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122126","id":5825446730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWzlDSg","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T02:00:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T02:00:35Z","body":"Another design question - should the entire deletion rectangle be rendered with the striped texture, or should the stripes only be applied to cells that have tiles that will be deleted?\n\nPersonally, I think placing the texture on the entire dragged rect area makes it clearer where the selection is. Also, if the user tries to erase cells that are already empty, this makes the UI feel more responsive rather than rendering nothing.\n\nEntire area:\n\n<img width=\"1123\" height=\"659\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6316f1e7-c5c5-441f-8571-6ed3b2223386\" />\nOnly nonempty cells (more familiar to the current functionality):\n\n<img width=\"1348\" height=\"749\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3134f5b3-aced-4777-b481-119b88ac87ed\" />\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5825446730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5847114749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122126#issuecomment-5847114749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122126","id":5847114749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXIPj_Q","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-26T14:36:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T14:36:35Z","body":"> Another design question - should the entire deletion rectangle be rendered with the striped texture, or should the stripes only be applied to cells that have tiles that will be deleted?\n> \n> Personally, I think placing the texture on the entire dragged rect area makes it clearer where the selection is. Also, if the user tries to erase cells that are already empty, this makes the UI feel more responsive rather than rendering nothing.\n\nBoth approaches seem fine to me.\nBut if you're going to open a PR, be sure to take non-rectangular tile layouts into account (as cell-coordinate-wise-rect is not always an actual rect, so drawing the entire drag-rect not always can be simplified with a single textured rect draw).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5847114749/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5900973383","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122126#issuecomment-5900973383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122126","id":5900973383,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABX7m1Rw","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","